	(text "DIN 41612 BACKPLANE CONNECTOR  (Type C, 96-way, 3x32 @ 2.54 mm):\nBoard:  Harting 09031966921  (right-angle male, 96-way, THT).\nMate:   Harting 09032966855  (vertical female, backplane side).\nContacts rated 2 A; the pinout is designed at 1.5 A derated, with every\nrail owning whole a/b/c columns.  See SLOT_PINOUT_v7.md.\nThis card drives +18V (col 7) and -18V (col 9); GND on cols 8 and 10.\nAC / transformer leads stay on screw terminal J5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
